<title>GERMANY: German Ymos 1996 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>German Ymos 1996 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			  16.4     down 2.4 million</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			 16.9     up   2.1 million</p>
<p>    Group sales				 957	vs   950</p>
<p>    Parent sales				724	vs   738</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German autoparts group is YMOS AG . The company said its 1996 results included high extraordinary income from the sale of its locking systems unit, which added 93.5 million marks to group profits.</p>
<p>The results also included high costs resulting from restructuring measures and risk provisions.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
